; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180 wave 1A; REBUILT sl-0187+0188): Twin Helix —
; grade 1, nebula pool. PLACEHOLDER descriptive id (designer's fish
; designs re-skin later; identity data-keyed). BEHAVIOURAL family
; (sl-0188): FLANKER — spirals to band and circle-strafes while the
; helix arms precess, phase speeds climb 2.2/2.6/3.0 (the standing-
; there statue is dead; never a CHASER — the one-room corner-trap law
; holds). hp 420 = 35s at the g1 spine (sl-0187: 20-60s INTENSE;
; cooldowns compressed ~x0.7). Every emitter telegraph == its
; pattern's ONE lead (mechanized law); elite amber; every number [T].
; Fight length gated by balance_calc GATE 7.

